# AI UX Flow

- AI suggestions must be reviewed before applying changes
- Present AI output as preview or diff, not auto-apply
- Provide undo or revert for accepted changes
- Disable inputs during in-flight requests
- Allow cancellation for streaming responses
- Debounce high-frequency AI triggers (typeahead, autocomplete)
